    "text": "<p>The arrangement of X<sup>-</sup> ions around A<sup>+</sup> ion in solid AX is given in the figure (not drawn to scale). If the radius of X<sup>-</sup> is 250 pm, the radius of A<sup>+</sup> is <br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/EM00012583_JEE_ADVANCED_2013.jpg\"/></p>",
